      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. it definitely captures the emotion. i want to make it even punchier by actually addressing the people who would fight against this—the ones who believe in private property and individual rights. how should the manifesto frame their arguments? i want to show why their views are basically just outdated obstacles to human progress.",
